 R←Test_Table_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;Tbl;cells;markdown;newCursorCol
⍝ `FormatTable` reports "not a table" rather than crashing when it is fed something else
⍝ R gets one of: 0=Okay, 1=test case failed, ¯1=test case was not executed due to the "batchFlag"
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 Tbl←##.Meddy.Tables

 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable('just prose' 'more prose')0 2
 →T.PassesIf ⍬≡cells
 →T.PassesIf ⍬≡markdown
 →T.PassesIf ⍬≡newCursorCol

 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable ⍬ 0 0
 →T.PassesIf ⍬≡cells
 →T.PassesIf ⍬≡markdown

 ⍝ A single row without a column devider is still a table
 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable(,⊂'| a | b |')0 2
 →T.PassesIf(,⊂'|a|b|')≡markdown

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
